{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/extras/steam_presentation_01_Your_journey_begins.png?t=1749204567\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0You are a homunculus, created and summoned by him\u2014<i>the Alchemist</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He speaks of distant lands and forgotten knowledge, traces of the ingredients for the ultimate alchemical creation: <i>the Philosopher's Stone</i>. He promised it holds the power to grant you a soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 And you? You\u2019d do <i>anything</i> to make that happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/extras/steam_presentation_04_gain_alchemical_abilities.png?t=1749204567\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/extras/ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1749204567\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft, cook, and brew your way to power\u2014stir the pot just right, and unlock incredible abilities unlike any you've seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/extras/hook2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1749204567\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/extras/steam_presentation_02_solve_intricate_puzzles.png?t=1749204567\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Driven by purpose and loyalty, you navigate through ancient castles and monasteries, where you face challenges. Use your logic and observation skills to get through the riddles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/extras/puzzle-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1749204567\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/extras/steam_presentation_03_brew_powerful_potions.png?t=1749204567\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Gather ingredients, find the right recipe and brew alchemical potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/extras/MIX-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1749204567\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> But as you follow the trail to complete your adventure, you sense something is wrong. A <strong>truth</strong> buried under layers of alchemical <strong><i>lies</i></strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Are you willing to do whatever it takes to claim a soul of your own?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3115240?t=1749204567","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/2c073f6a36d0041aa589b26ec111b36eda05e148/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749204567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/24a6811d756a2323061bfd8e677b166a554a2374/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749204567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/24a6811d756a2323061bfd8e677b166a554a2374/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749204567","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3726690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/extras/steam_presentation_01_Your_journey_begins.png?t=1749204567\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0You are a homunculus, created and summoned by him\u2014<i>the Alchemist</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He speaks of distant lands and forgotten knowledge, traces of the ingredients for the ultimate alchemical creation: <i>the Philosopher's Stone</i>. He promised it holds the power to grant you a soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 And you? You\u2019d do <i>anything</i> to make that happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/extras/steam_presentation_04_gain_alchemical_abilities.png?t=1749204567\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/extras/ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1749204567\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft, cook, and brew your way to power\u2014stir the pot just right, and unlock incredible abilities unlike any you've seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/extras/hook2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1749204567\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/extras/steam_presentation_02_solve_intricate_puzzles.png?t=1749204567\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Driven by purpose and loyalty, you navigate through ancient castles and monasteries, where you face challenges. Use your logic and observation skills to get through the riddles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/extras/puzzle-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1749204567\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/extras/steam_presentation_03_brew_powerful_potions.png?t=1749204567\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Gather ingredients, find the right recipe and brew alchemical potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/extras/MIX-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1749204567\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> But as you follow the trail to complete your adventure, you sense something is wrong. A <strong>truth</strong> buried under layers of alchemical <strong><i>lies</i></strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Are you willing to do whatever it takes to claim a soul of your own?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["OnSkull Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115240/c9be375c3efd330ac9024dc6cc284e088805405e/header.jpg?t=1749204567","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257140175,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140175/movie480.mp4?t=1747642295","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140175/movie_max.mp4?t=1747642295"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257140175/bb21585f676cfc0a7a778e16b50500c771c33345/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747642295","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140175/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747642295","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140175/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747642295"}}],"name":"Alchemist: Journey of